  "description": {
   "text": "Doom\n(Alteration)\n\nLevel: 1\nSphere: Charm\nRange: 25 ft.\nDuration: 1 turn\nCasting Time: 1\nArea of Effect: 1 creature\nSaving Throw: Neg.\n\nThis spell causes a feeling of doom to overwhelm the target. For the duration of the spell, the target receives a -2 penalty to THAC0, damage rolls, and Saving Throws unless the target makes a Saving Throw vs. Spell (with an additional -1 penalty at 3rd, 5th, 7th, and 9th level, up to -4).\n\nTyped spell effects: THAC0 -2 (Curse); damage -2 (Curse); save vs. death -2 (Curse); save vs. wands -2 (Curse); save vs. polymorph -2 (Curse); save vs. breath -2 (Curse); save vs. spell -2 (Curse); Values may depend on caster level and target.",
